@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5267

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

# Transaction Endpoints

### Create Transaction
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": 1,
  "date": "2024-12-15T10:30:00",
  "categoryId": 3,
  "amount": 125.50,
  "note": "Weekly grocery shopping at Trader Joe's"
}

###

### Get Transaction by ID
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/transaction/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Transactions for Household
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/transaction/household/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Transactions by Date Range
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/transaction/household/1?startDate=2024-12-01&endDate=2024-12-31
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Transactions by Category
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/transaction/household/1?categoryId=3
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Transactions for Specific Month
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/transaction/household/1/month/2024/12
Accept: application/json

###

### Update Transaction
PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/transaction/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2024-12-15T11:00:00",
  "categoryId": 3,
  "amount": 135.75,
  "note": "Updated grocery amount"
}

###

### Get Spending Summary
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/transaction/household/1/summary?startDate=2024-12-01&endDate=2024-12-31
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Budget vs Actual Comparison
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/transaction/budget/1/vs-actual
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete Transaction
DELETE {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/transaction/1

###

# Module Progress Endpoints

### Get All Financial Modules
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/referencedata/financial-modules
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Financial Modules with User Progress
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/referencedata/financial-modules/user/2
Accept: application/json

###

### Get User Learning Progress Overview
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/referencedata/financial-modules/user/2/progress
Accept: application/json

###

### Update Module Progress
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/referencedata/financial-modules/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "moduleId": 1,
  "progressPercentage": 50,
  "isCompleted": false
}

###

### Mark Module as Complete
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/referencedata/financial-modules/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "moduleId": 1,
  "progressPercentage": 100,
  "isCompleted": true
}

###

### Get Specific Module Progress
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/referencedata/financial-modules/1/user/2/progress
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete Module Progress
DELETE {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/referencedata/financial-modules/1/user/2/progress

