# Enhanced Budget & Debt Endpoints

### Generate Debt Avalanche Projection
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/budget/debt/avalanche
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": 1,
  "monthlySurplus": 500
}

###

### Compare Snowball vs Avalanche Methods
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/budget/debt/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": 1,
  "monthlySurplus": 500
}

###

### Get 12-Month Budget Projection
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/budget/1/projection/12-month
Accept: application/json

###

### Validate Budget Against Guardrails
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/budget/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": 1,
  "categoryAmounts": {
    "1": 2500,
    "2": 150,
    "3": 400,
    "4": 200,
    "9": 300,
    "10": 150
  }
}

###

### Check Budget Guardrails Only
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/budget/guardrails
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": 1,
  "categoryAmounts": {
    "1": 3000,
    "3": 600
  }
}

###

### Get Reallocation Suggestions
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/budget/suggestions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": 1,
  "categoryAmounts": {
    "1": 2500,
    "3": 500,
    "9": 600,
    "10": 400
  }
}

