# Goal Management Endpoints

### Create Goal
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/goal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": 1,
  "type": "emergency_fund",
  "name": "Emergency Fund - 6 Months",
  "targetAmount": 30000,
  "targetDate": "2025-12-31",
  "priority": 1
}

###

### Get Goal by ID
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/goal/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Household Goals
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/goal/household/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Goals by Type
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/goal/household/1?type=emergency_fund
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Goal Dashboard
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/goal/household/1/dashboard
Accept: application/json

###

### Update Goal
PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/goal/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "emergency_fund",
  "name": "Emergency Fund - Updated",
  "targetAmount": 35000,
  "targetDate": "2026-06-30",
  "priority": 1
}

###

### Delete Goal
DELETE {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/goal/1

